# Issues require a Radicle patch

When finishing work for **any** Linear, GitHub, or Radicle issue that produces commits:

1. Push the commits to GitHub (`origin`).
2. Open a Radicle patch with the **boxci-github-patch** skill (`.cursor/skills/boxci-github-patch/`).
3. Do this even if a GitHub PR was also opened — a PR does not replace the patch.

